# MPAS-A chemistry profile with full tracer coverage from merra2_chm_dump.txt.
# Use with MERRA-2 chemistry collection: inst3_3d_chm_Nv
# MERRA-2 CO is mol/mol; MPAS co is typically kg/kg, so apply Mw(CO)/Mw(air).
# Fixed greenhouse gases are in MPAS output units (kg/kg):
# CO2 = 400 ppmv * 1e-6 * Mw(CO2)/Mw(air) = 6.0766e-4
# CH4 = 1.7 ppmv * 1e-6 * Mw(CH4)/Mw(air) = 9.4125e-7

o3 -> 1.0*[O3];1.0
co -> 1.0*[CO];0.966862271
co2 -> 6.0766e-4;1.0
ch4 -> 9.4125e-7;1.0
